# Archive exclusion

Unless the user explicitly asks to inspect archived history, do not list, search, index, open, summarize, cite, or use files under:

- `docs/archive/**`
- `inbox/archive/**`

Do not automatically follow links into those directories. Use active code and documents as the current source of truth. Follow `ARCHIVE_POLICY.md` for the narrow exceptions and document lifecycle.
